WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:02.217
On your phone, open Quick update.

2
00:00:02.217 --> 00:00:05.605
Tap Add a question.

3
00:00:05.605 --> 00:00:10.497
Ask it the way a client would.

4
00:00:10.497 --> 00:00:15.449
Answer it simply.

5
00:00:15.449 --> 00:00:18.574
Not sure of the group?
Leave it, and move it later.

6
00:00:18.574 --> 00:00:23.007
Tap the button. It goes
at the end of its group.
